      "source_text": "是因为附近的批发商有些奇怪的传闻，我才下的决心，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I made up my mind because there were some strange rumors among the nearby wholesalers,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01969",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "如果千重子小姐不便说，由家父或我去说好了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If Miss Chieko finds it hard to say, my father or I can say it for her.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01969",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "但小姐说是最上策。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But she said that would be the best course.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01969",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "掌柜的态度有变化了吧？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The head clerk's attitude has changed, hasn't it?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
